        "description": "Deployed preview. What is this name or id? Companies, funds and listed shares, with their stable ids (CNPJ, ISIN).\n\nThe company rows (id_type cd_cvm) of the lookup answer; truncated still says when more than 20 entries matched.\n\nThis playground selects `company` on `GET /search`. See the [full resource reference](/api-docs/v2/reference/search) for all variants.",
