            "name": "q",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "A ticker, ISIN, CNPJ, CVM code, or words of a company or fund name (every word must match, accents and case ignored). Default: empty: list the research universe (kind any or company) or every fund (kind fund, which refuses above its tier ceiling).",
